{
  "module": "ps2ur",
  "version": 0,
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the managed<->native boundary (ADR-002,",
    "plan 12.4). tools/bindgen/bindgen.py gen-all regenerates:",
    "  managed/PS2.UnityShim/Internal/Native.g.cs",
    "  runtime/src/bridge/generated_bridge.h / generated_bridge.cpp",
    "  docs/bridge-surface.md",
    "Hand-edits to those files are forbidden; implementations of the",
    "prototypes live in runtime/src/bridge/bridge_impl.cpp.",
    "Handles are {index+1, generation} packed in an i32; 0 is never valid.",
    "Setters take scalar floats (no struct-by-value ABI questions); getters",
    "fill a caller-owned out struct."
  ],
  "types": [
