    {
      "name": "ps2ur_anim_update",
      "cs_class": "UnityEngine.Internal.Native",
      "doc": "Advances every animator by dt and writes their root motion back to entity transforms. The managed dispatcher calls this AFTER Update and coroutines and BEFORE LateUpdate, which is the ordering Unity users rely on (M9 task 4).",
