      "name": "ps2ur_scene_load_begin",
      "cs_class": "UnityEngine.Internal.Native",
      "doc": "Starts an async scene load into the host-provided scene buffer (bridge::bind_scene_buffer). additive != 0 appends to the running world instead of replacing it. Returns 1 when the load started. Only one load is in flight at a time; starting a second while one runs is refused.",
